{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_BA*A","canonical_person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_BA*A","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["3ea_uzt_2n2_BA*A"],"persons":[{"id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_B","label":"何澄（字季玄，何准子）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"澄","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p001:m0164","c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002:m0000","c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002:m0101","c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001:m0012"]},{"surface":"季玄","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002:m0002"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-093","source_id":"s-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context-ws1548000","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p001","quote":"澄","mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p001:m0164"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-093","source_id":"s-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context-ws1548000","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002","quote":"澄","mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002:m0000"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-093","source_id":"s-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context-ws1548000","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002","quote":"澄","mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002:m0101"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-093","source_id":"s-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context-ws1548000","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002","quote":"季玄","mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002:m0002"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-041","source_id":"s-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context-ws2634831","chapter_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001","quote":"澄","mention_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001:m0012"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"晉書外戚傳列何准三子，另敘澄字季玄，安帝即位後遷尚書左僕射；宋書卷四十一記何瑀為其曾孫。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2","source_assertion_id":"a-nan023-heyucontext-zhun-child-澄","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-093","source_id":"s-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context-ws1548000","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p001","quote":"何准，字幼道，穆章皇后父也。高尚寡欲，弱冠知名，州府交辟，並不就。兄充為驃騎將軍，勸其令仕，准曰：「第五之名何滅驃騎？」准兄弟中第五，故有此言。充居宰輔之重，權傾一時，而准散帶衡門，不及人事，唯誦佛經，修營塔廟而已。徵拜散騎郎，不起。年四十七卒。昇平元年，追贈金紫光祿大夫，封晉興縣侯。子惔以父素行高潔，表讓不受。三子：放、惔、澄。放繼充。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p001:m0164","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p001:m0000"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"何准傳以三子連舉三人。","human_reviewed":false}},{"id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_BA","label":"何融（晉元熙大司農，何澄次子）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"融","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002:m0164","c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001:m0018"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-093","source_id":"s-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context-ws1548000","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002","quote":"融","mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002:m0164"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-041","source_id":"s-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context-ws2634831","chapter_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001","quote":"融","mention_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001:m0018"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"晉書何澄傳具次子融、元熙大司農。宋書卷四十一記何瑀祖融官大司農；晉書謝尚傳另載352年戴施參軍何融，兩者欠缺同指原證。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_B","source_assertion_id":"a-nan023-heyucontext-cheng-child-融","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-093","source_id":"s-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context-ws1548000","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002","quote":"澄字季玄，起家秘書郎，轉丞，清正有器望，累遷秘書監、太常、中護軍。孝武帝深愛之，以為冠軍將軍、吳國內史。太元末，琅邪王出居外第，妙選師傅，徵拜尚書，領琅邪王師。安帝即位，遷尚書左僕射，典選、王師如故。時澄腳疾，固讓，特聽不朝，坐家視事。又領本州大中正。及桓玄執政，以疾奏免，卒於家。安帝反正，追贈金紫光祿大夫。長子籍，早卒。次子融，元熙中，為大司農。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002:m0164","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-093-heyu-grandfather-context:p002:m0000"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"何澄傳末分記兩子。","human_reviewed":false}},{"id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_BA*A","label":"何瑀（字稚玉，何融孫）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"瑀","mention_ids":["c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001:m0000"]},{"surface":"稚玉","mention_ids":["c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001:m0003"]},{"surface":"何瑀","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-023-wangzao:p003:m0066"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-041","source_id":"s-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context-ws2634831","chapter_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001","quote":"瑀","mention_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001:m0000"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-041","source_id":"s-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context-ws2634831","chapter_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001","quote":"稚玉","mention_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001:m0003"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-023","source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangzao-ws2478204","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzao","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzao:p003","quote":"何瑀","mention_id":"c-nanshi-023-wangzao:p003:m0066"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"宋書卷四十一稱瑀字稚玉、何澄曾孫、大司農融之孫；南史卷十一傳首字幼玉，王藻卷引其事。其父姓名未見所據原句，保留一個未名世代。","family_path":{"connection":"grandfather","generation_distance":2,"ancestor_person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_BA","parent_person_id":null,"intermediate_person_ids":[null],"source_assertion_id":"a-nan023-heyucontext-yu-rong","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-041","source_id":"s-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context-ws2634831","chapter_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001","quote":"瑀，字稚玉，晉尚書左僕射澄曾孫也。祖融，大司農。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001:m0018"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"宋書何皇后家系原文載瑀祖融，所隔父一世闕名。","human_reviewed":false}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context-ws2634831","work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-041","chapter_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context","raw_mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001:m0000","c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001:m0003"],"paragraph_ids":["c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001:m0000","mention_ids":["c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001:m0000"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001:m0003","mention_ids":["c-songshu-041-heyu-ancestors-context:p001:m0003"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":2,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":2,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"2處獨立位置，2個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"},{"source_id":"s-nanshi-023-wangzao-ws2478204","work_id":"w-nanshi",